<title>GREECE: Greek Flexopack says H1 profit/turnover up 4.5pct.</title>
<headline>Greek Flexopack says H1 profit/turnover up 4.5pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek synthetic packaging film producer Flexopack said in a statement that its first-half pretax earnings rose 4.5 percent to 280 million drachmas from 268 million in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Turnover also increased 4.5 percent to 1.63 billion drachmas in the first six months of 1997 from 1.56 billion in the same period in 1996, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
